WEBVTT

07:02.740 --> 07:06.369
- PYP: They'll need an eighth hell to fit him in.
- (LAUGHTER)

07:06.494 --> 07:08.413
Tell them your name.

07:08.538 --> 07:10.456
Samwell Tarly,

07:10.581 --> 07:14.502
of Horn Hill...
I mean, I was of Horn Hill.

07:14.627 --> 07:16.212
I've come to take the black.

07:16.337 --> 07:18.965
- Come to take the black pudding.
- (LAUGHTER)

07:19.090 --> 07:21.968
Well, you couldn't be
any worse than you look.

07:22.093 --> 07:24.012
Rast...

07:24.137 --> 07:26.139
see what he can do.
